WEBVTT

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.950
<i>Don't you think there's something wrong with him?</i>

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.230
<i>What is?</i>

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.930
<i>No, it's as if he's panicking.</i>

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.670
<i>It's like he's not himself.</i>

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.850
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.000
<i>Of course!</i>

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.300
<i>He has to make up for the loss.</i>

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.460
<i>What are you panicking for, Capeta?!</i>

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.870
<i>Your emotions are heating up and your time is suffering!</i>

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.140
<i>Shut up, Nobu!</i>

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.450
<i>It's Ca-chan.</i>

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.130
<i>He must have some plan!</i>

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.350
<i>Stop saying negative stuff!</i>

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.120
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.900
<i>Just a bit more...</i>

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.560
<i>I should be able to do more...</i>

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.040
<i>More!</i>

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:24.130
I thought so.  He's slowly falling behind Hata.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.210
Calm down, Capeta!

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.530
You can keep up with her if you drive normally!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.050
What's the point in following her?!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.640
He has to overtake her!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.980
B-But...

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.350
It's better than driving slower, isn't it?

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.290
He has to come in 1st.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.940
We're now in the 6th lap of the race!

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.020
Top is Ishihara!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:47.410
<b>A powerful drive, showing pride as a retired FSte driver!</b>

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.480
<b>2nd is Shiba!</b>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.430
<b>He's slowly falling behind!</b>

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.210
<b>3rd, Hata!</b>

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.570
<b>Taira, in 4th, is also falling behind!</b>

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:02.800
<b>Only 10 laps to go!</b>

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.840
<b>Will this race end without any more action?!</b>

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.230
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.630
<i>Just a bit more!</i>

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.890
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.110
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.870
<i>There's something wrong with his angle from the reflection in the mirrors.</i>

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.080
<i>Popping in and out every so often...</i>

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:44.460
<i>Stop coming in from a weird line out of panic.</i>

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:48.380
<i>I don't care if you're trying to make an all-or-nothing attack,</i>

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.420
<i>but my future is at stake here, so don't drag me into it!</i>

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:56.330
<i>Th-That wasn't so bad just now.</i>

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.560
<i>One more time!</i>

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.730
Oh?  His pace went up.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.060
Yeah.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.580
He followed close behind her on that last corner.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.570
You see?

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.150
Go, go!

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.870
Capeta!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.250
<i>W-What about the brakes?!</i>

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.080
<b>Taira attacks Hata on the 1st corner!</b>

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.040
<i>Not yet...  Not yet!</i>

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.140
<i>Further in!</i>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.920
<i>Here!</i>

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.680
He passed her!

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:47.310
<b>Hata takes it back from the inside!</b>

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>This is a nice battle!</b>

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.320
<b>Excellent!</b>

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.670
Taira continues to follow her tail closely!

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.280
He's being cautious!  He's being cautious!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.350
That was so close!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.540
He went in too sharply.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:05.450
No.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.250
The way he's entering now is correct.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:10.780
It's just the recovery afterwards that's still not right.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:16.680
If he gets his recovery right after braking, he'll be driving like Naomi.

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:18.280
O-Oh yeah!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.160
That's it.  That's it!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.140
It's Naomi!

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.890
I was surprised last year.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:28.650
I thought there was one guy driving strangely.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.930
But for some reason his time was very good.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.140
Of course.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.100
He has the theory right.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.010
It's just that no one's tried it.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.740
<b>Again on the 1st corner!</b>

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:47.790
<b>Taira goes from the inside!</b>

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.420
<b>This time he succeeds!</b>

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.670
<i>All right!</i>

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.760
Taira rises up to 3rd!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.500
All right!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.530
You see?!  You see?!

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.720
As expected!  Ca-chan is the best!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.260
He can do it... the recovery.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.690
You're right.  It's exactly the same as Naomi!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.660
But why all of a sudden?

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:16.440
<i>He passed me...</i>

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.490
<i>How did he get in?!</i>

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.550
<i>Yes!</i>

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.370
<i>All right!  I did it!</i>

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.040
<i>The Formula is amazing!</i>

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.880
<i>I wouldn't be able to do this on a kart!</i>

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.480
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.330
<i>The Formula is such fun!</i>

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:40.070
<i>That was really good just now, that overtake.</i>

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.050
<i>He must have come up with something.</i>

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:51.180
<i>He was turning the 1st corner in an odd way because he must have been trying something out.</i>

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.440
<i>His driving is totally different from when he was driving a kart!</i>

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:59.150
Ca-chan is doing well.  Right, Nobu?

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:00.610
Yeah.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.750
<b>Top is Ishihara!</b>

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.290
<b>His best lap so far is 30.72 seconds!</b>

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.710
<b>He's now going through the main straight and on to the 9th lap!</b>

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:17.500
<b>Shiba in 2nd is...</b>

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.970
<b>30.93 seconds!</b>

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.190
Taira, who made an excellent overtake and rose up to 3rd place...!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:33.110
His best lap is 31.10 seconds!

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:34.740
<b>4th is Hata.</b>

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.060
<b>31.15 seconds!</b>

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:36.820
<b>5th, Daiki.</b>

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.300
31.21 seconds!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.820
Things are heating up!  They're heating up!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:46.480
Only 7 laps to go.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:49.120
There's almost 3 seconds between him and Shiba.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.080
If only there were 10 laps!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.590
<i>And just when he came up with something!</i>

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:59.860
It's always like this for us!

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.550
Damn it!

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:02.890
What are you saying?!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:06.010
Ca-chan will get faster from here on!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.210
Everyone's in the same car, right?!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.980
Then obviously Ca-chan is the fastest!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:16.480
W-What?

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:18.600
<i>That's right.</i>

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.350
<i>It's like she said.</i>

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.350
<i>It's the same, but the one thing...</i>

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.200
<i>the one thing that's different is that...</i>

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.300
<i>we don't have any handicap on the machine!</i>

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:42.730
<i>I won't give up!</i>

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:46.300
<i>Shiba is far, but it's not like I can't see him!</i>

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.610
<i>In a race...</i>

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:59.070
<i>In a race, you can't tell what will happen until the very end!</i>

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:21.530
Good.  He's okay using the tires vertically.

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:26.270
Before the crash, he was driving like he was on a kart.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.660
Yeah.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.720
Why did he change all of a sudden?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.680
I did mention briefly in the meeting...

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.730
that formula tires are radial and their resistance is stronger vertically.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.580
Therefore, you're faster if you minimize the time spent turning.

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:44.040
Well, that's common sense.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:48.990
But I never saw driving like this until Naomi last year.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:54.330
Well, even if you know it logically, no one does it this far normally.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:10:00.150
When drivers like these come along 2 years in a row...

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.840
Maybe the generations are changing.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:12.100
<i>In any case...</i>

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.860
<i>Would you change your driving style all of a sudden just because you have an idea?</i>

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:17.730
<i>And in the middle of an audition.</i>

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.940
<i>It's not a matter of generations.</i>

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.430
<i>His turns are getting sharper, too.</i>

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:02.500
It's out!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.650
His best time!  31 seconds flat!

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.860
He's blown away his record time in the qualifier!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.440
Not yet!

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:13.510
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...{M: or "mess up" but direct tl is "trip"}

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.440
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.390
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:16.450
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.400
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.330
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.510
Crash...  Trip...  Trip...  Crash...

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:20.400
Crash...  Trip...  Trip...  Crash...

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.370
Crash...  Trip...  Trip...  Crash...

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:22.490
Crash...  Trip...  Trip...  Crash...

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.530
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.550
U-Umm... Monami-chan.  What are you doing?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.440
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:25.320
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.550
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.650
I was wondering if Shiba will mess up.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:31.810
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip!

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:32.650
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.400
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip!

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.270
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:35.640
Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip...  Trip!

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:37.430
<i>She's sending a telepathic wave...</i>

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:41.640
<i>C-Certainly if Capeta continues at this pace...</i>

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:43.900
<i>It's possible...</i>

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.530
<i>he could overturn this 3-second gap!</i>

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:56.950
<i>You can't get the scholarship unless you finish top amongst all the students!</i>

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.460
<i>Capeta!</i>

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.610
<b>There's not much more left!</b>

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:04.280
<b>Taira, who has shortened his time down to 31 seconds flat!</b>

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.480
<b>How will you fight?!</b>

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.680
Damn!  He still has far to go until Shiba.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.710
I guess 4 laps isn't enough.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.060
And when he's doing so well.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:26.920
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:29.940
<i>Whatever I try, it doesn't seem like I'm getting any closer!</i>

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.890
<b>Top, Ishihara!</b>

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.690
<b>His 12th lap is 30.68 seconds!</b>

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.770
<b>Three laps to go!</b>

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.560
Shiba is 30.89 seconds!

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.580
He's done it!  His best record so far!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:44.040
<i>Ryou...  You've grown.</i>

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:47.040
<i>The defeat at Haruna wasn't a complete waste.</i>

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:50.850
<i>All you have to do now is drive straight...  Drive facing forward.</i>

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:53.510
<i>Don't turn back, Ryou!</i>

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:59.880
<i>At Haruna, Shiba made a couple of mistakes at the end that were big.</i>

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.170
<i>But...</i>

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:04.660
<i>from the start, Shiba has been rock solid here.</i>

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:05.980
<i>It doesn't look like he'll mess up.</i>

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.900
<i>The enemy has also grown!</i>

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.110
<i>Aren't there any more chances?!</i>

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.620
<b>Taira, 30.89 seconds!</b>

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:21.830
<b>He's done it!</b>

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:27.210
<b>Taira has finally entered the 30-second range, too!</b>

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.170
It's the exact same time as Shiba's record in the qualifier!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.290
He...

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.310
Banzai!  Banzai!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.880
Banzai!  Banzai!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.490
Amazing!

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.810
Capeta!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.730
<i>I can't tell anymore!</i>

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:53.030
<i>Am I falling behind or am I getting closer?!</i>

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:00.320
<i>It's far!</i>

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.430
<i>It's impossible with just 3 laps.</i>

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.450
<i>I can't catch up!</i>

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.020
<i>The race is...</i>

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:07.880
<i>Or rather...</i>

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.000
<i>It's not just racing...</i>

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:16.220
<i>It's over for those who really think they're finished.</i>

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.570
<i>No...</i>

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.790
<i>You say that but...</i>

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.390
<i>What's impossible is impossible!</i>

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.530
2 laps to go!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:26.930
2 laps remaining!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.690
Ryou!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.110
<i>Just 2 more laps!</i>

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:39.150
Oh, God!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.270
<b>Taira!</b>

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.080
<b>He's done it!  30.89 seconds again!</b>

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.240
How about it?  How about it, Shin-chan?

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.550
My recommendation.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.510
When did he become your recommendation?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:04.220
It's not like I have time to be teaching others either.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.590
Huh?  Did you say something?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.640
No.  Nothing.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.600
<i>Before...</i>

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:21.740
<i>Before I dropped behind this much,
wasn't there something I could have done?</i>

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.780
<i>No, even before that...</i>

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.010
<i>Before I took the audition.</i>

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.840
<i>Wasn't there something I could have done?!</i>

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.960
<i>Minamoto!</i>

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.670
<i>What would you have done?!</i>

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.880
<i>Like I'd tell you.</i>

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.050
Go, Ca-chan!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.020
Put more speed into it!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:53.520
<i>On this circuit, the 1st corner is the only place where he could possibly overtake.</i>

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.490
<i>If I can't catch up to him before the next 1st corner...</i>

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.700
<i>It's over!</i>

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:07.360
<b>The top, Ishihara, turns the last corner and into the final lap!</b>

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.660
<b>Followed by Shiba!</b>

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.080
Go, go!

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:25.300
Capeta!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.720
Go!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:26.720
Overtake him!

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:33.450
<b>Shiba also enters the final lap and turns at the 1st corner!</b>

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:35.230
Ca-chan!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:12.100
<i>Who cares what happens!</i>

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:07.320
<b>Ishihara finishes in 1st!</b>

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.470
<b>Followed by Shiba!</b>

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.450
<b>He finishes top amongst the students!</b>

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.530
You did it, Ryou!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.580
<b>3rd place is Taira!</b>

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.000
<b>Oh?  Oh!</b>

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.040
<b>This final lap...</b>

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.860
30.85 seconds!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:06.490
Taira has the fastest lap amongst the students, with a record of 30.85 seconds!

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.770
30.85 seconds!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.530
It's here, it's here, it's here!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:15.430
30.85 seconds!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:20.080
What did he say just now?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.510
N-Nobu-kun...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.310
He did it, he did it!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.320
Fastest out of all the students?!

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:31.360
Ryou was beaten?!

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:35.280
By a boy who couldn't even start the machine on the first day.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:45.420
<i>Minamoto Naomi, the same age...</i>

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.920
<i>Taira, a year below...</i>

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:54.390
<i>Whichever category Ryou participates in,
 he will be with one of them.</i>

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:58.850
<i>Th-This is going to be tough!</i>

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:03.410
I did it!

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.830
Well done.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.750
You got it.  30.85 seconds.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.800
You're the fastest out of all the students.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:49.270
Capeta!  You—

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.700
Capeta.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.100
Ca-chan.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.840
<i>I lost... to Shiba.</i>

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.030
<i>And on the same machine!</i>

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:52.980
I lost to Shiba on the same machine!

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:57.050
I bet there's no chance of me getting that scholarship now.

00:22:57.050 --> 00:22:59.910
What am I supposed to do now?

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:01.900
Next time, on Capeta.

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:02.930
Pit In!

00:23:02.930 --> 00:23:04.940
Open up the future!
